3. Hypothalamus, olfactory bulbs and spinal cord are simple approximations generated by
   the build script at standard MNI positions.

Receptor structure (6HUP.pdb.gz): PDB entry 6HUP, human alpha1beta3gamma2 GABA-A receptor
with GABA and diazepam (Masiulis S, et al. Nature 2019;565:454-459), from the RCSB Protein
Data Bank (https://www.rcsb.org/structure/6HUP), unmodified apart from gzip compression.
Data files in the PDB archive are available under the CC0 1.0 Universal public domain
